<%# locals: (record:) %>
<%# What a Deposit, Spend or Refund that was filed from a bank transaction says on its edit page: where it came from, and that deleting it un-files that bank transaction. The record is otherwise ordinary, and a typed-in one says nothing. %>
<% bank_transaction = record.bank_transaction %>
<% if bank_transaction %>
  <p class="mt-4 text-base-content/70">
    Filed from a bank transaction in <%= link_to bank_transaction.account.name, account_path(bank_transaction.account), class: "link" %>,
    <%= spelled_date(bank_transaction.date) %>, <%= bank_transaction.description %>. Deleting it un-files that bank transaction.
  </p>
<% end %>
